# The park's NPC skaters keep off the S.K.A.T.E. lane while a game is on. In free skate their lines
# cross it now and then (two at once here); once Dre comes out, any NPC on the lane (or on a line
# over it) goes to watch from the crowd spots beside it, standing, and the rest ride lines clear of
# it. When the game is over (here: run free), the watchers ride again. (Phase 12 changed how NPCs
# ride, so the game starts later than it used to, after they have crossed the lane.)
park soma
cmd 0 npc spawn
cmd 3500 run skate dre
cmd 9500 run free
run 14000
expect max npcs.onlane >= 1 over 0..3500
expect max npcs.watching <= 0 over 0..3500
expect max npcs.onlane <= 0 over 3502..9500
expect max npcs.watching >= 1 over 3502..9500
expect event skateSet{by=local,trick=impossible,at=0.03} within 4096..4104
expect event skateMatch{by=player,ok=false,reason=time,at=-1} within 7336..7344
expect max npcs.watching <= 0 over 9502..14000
expect npcs.riding == 4 at end
